OL,3,CFirefighters near 'breaking point' as
OL,4,Cwildfire response sees '15-hour shifts'
OL,6,FA member of the Fire Brigades Union
OL,7,F(FBU) has told ITV News that crews
OL,8,Fbattling wildfires across Wales have
OL,9,Fbeen working for "14-15 hours", with
OL,10,Fservices "close to breaking point".
OL,12,FDuncan Stewart-Ball, Wales' Regional
OL,13,FSecretary at the FBU, described the
OL,14,Fconstant fight against wildfires as
OL,15,F"relentless".
OL,17,FThe Welsh Government has committed to
OL,18,Fa wildfire summit, exploring ways
OL,19,FWales' response to large-fires can be
OL,20,Fstrengthened and made more resilient.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/6
