OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786551523
OL,3,CFirefighters near 'breaking point' as
OL,4,Cwildfire response sees '15-hour shifts'
OL,6,FIt comes after a second wildfire major
OL,7,Fincident was declared, this time
OL,8,Faround Llangynidr Reservoir, in Ebbw
OL,9,FVale. It follows a string of wildfires
OL,10,Facross the country.
OL,12,FMr Stewart-Ball: "These jobs are
OL,13,Fbecoming more frequent, they are
OL,14,Fbigger and they are resource-heavy.
OL,15,FThey are leaving fire and rescue
OL,16,Fservices in a position where they're
OL,17,Fclose to breaking point.
OL,26,@tD@ROU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786551523
OL,3,CFirefighters near 'breaking point' as
OL,4,Cwildfire response sees '15-hour shifts'
OL,6,F"Members on the fire ground are
OL,7,Fworking 14-15 hours and then having to
OL,8,Fgo to their main employment, then back
OL,9,Fto the fire ground.
OL,11,F"It's relentless. It's continuous. Our
OL,12,Ffirefighters are tired."
OL,14,FIt comes after the FBU have called on
OL,15,Fthe Welsh Government for a wildfire
OL,16,Fsummit to provide crews with better
OL,17,Fresources to tackle large-scale fires.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUtD@XO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/6
