PN,43604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786551523
OL,3,CFirefighters near 'breaking point' as
OL,4,Cwildfire response sees '15-hour shifts'
OL,6,FWith Wales having 400 fewer
OL,7,Ffirefighters than in 2010, Mr Stewart-
OL,8,FBall told ITV News that the future of
OL,9,Fthe industry is a concern.
OL,11,FHe said: "I do worry. We need
OL,12,Finvestment, we need more firefighters
OL,13,Fon the ground, we need better
OL,14,Fequipment.
OL,16,F"Plaid Cymru have got an opportunity
OL,17,Fto get the fire and rescue services
OL,18,Facross Wales to a place where they
OL,19,Fneed to be."
OL,26,@sD@JOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/6
