OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786551523
OL,3,CFirefighters near 'breaking point' as
OL,4,Cwildfire response sees '15-hour shifts'
OL,6,FAnthony Jones, Assistant Chief Fire
OL,7,FOfficer at North Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,8,FService, said that the Welsh
OL,9,FGovernment's plans for a multi-agency
OL,10,Fsummit is "welcomed".
OL,12,FHe explained: "It's been really,
OL,13,Freally challenging. Our firefighters,
OL,14,Four control staff, our partners and
OL,15,Four corporate services teams have
OL,16,Fworked tirelessly.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786551523
OL,3,CFirefighters near 'breaking point' as
OL,4,Cwildfire response sees '15-hour shifts'
OL,6,F"We really welcome the opportunity to
OL,7,Fcome together as Wales with our
OL,8,Fcolleagues in the other fire and
OL,9,Frescue services, and also our
OL,10,Fpartners, to think about how we can
OL,11,Fwork with colleagues to prevent these
OL,12,Ffires from happening in the first
OL,13,Fplace."
OL,15,FIn a statement, the Welsh Government
OL,16,Fsaid: "The First Minister has
OL,17,Fcommitted to convene a multi-agency
OL,18,Fsummit to consider how we can best
OL,19,Fstrengthen wildfire prevention and
OL,20,Fresilience."
OL,26,@xD@GOU
